  "keyFeatures": [
    "Blocks all banner, video, and audio ads in the Spotify desktop client",
    "Optional hiding of podcasts, episodes, and audiobooks from the homepage",
    "Optional blocking of Spotify automatic updates",
    "Disables analytics and telemetry sending",
    "Applies and manages Spotify experimental features",
    "Supports multiple installation themes (new and old Spotify UI)",
    "Advanced CLI parameters for fully automated/scriptable installs",
    "Multilingual installer supporting 34+ languages",
    "Static lyrics color themes (26 color options)",
    "Microsoft Defender exclusion management to prevent false positives"
